  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The respective displacements (in <math> <mrow> <mtext>cm</mtext></mrow> </math>)&nbsp;of two particles of a medium disturbed by&nbsp;a wave propagation at&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>x</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow> </math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;given by the equations:<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>y</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>sin</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext>&#960;t</mtext></mrow> </math><br />\r<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>y</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>sin</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow> </math></p>\r\r<p>The speed of the wave is</p>\r",
